KKR Q4'25 Earnings Release

NEW YORK, February 05, 2026--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KKR & Co. Inc. (NYSE: KKR) today reported its fourth quarter 2025 results, which have been posted to the Investor Center section of KKR’s website at https://ir.kkr.com/events-presentations/.

A conference call to discuss KKR’s financial results will be held today, Thursday, February 5, 2026 at 9:00 a.m. ET. The conference call may be accessed by dialing (877) 407-0312 (U.S. callers) or +1 (201) 389-0899 (non-U.S. callers);
